silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_07_backend_routing_observability_sections_03_observability_and_trace_concrete_anchor_5#mittensvetrecordbackendtarget silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordBackendTarget is The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'BackendTarget', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
